-- emit: the SAME declarations as `app/DceSurvivorOrder.beni` with nothing
-- dropped — a `--library` build roots every `pub` value, so this golden is
-- the full walk's order, `zed, dead, later` (`docs/design/backend.md` §9,
-- the join's second step). Filtering `dead` out of that sequence would keep
-- `zed` before `later`; the app fixture's golden shows the build emits
-- `later` first. The pair makes the amendment executable: the order is the
-- SURVIVING walk's own, replayed, never a full sequence filtered.
pub dead : Int → Int
dead n = zed (n + 1)


pub later : Int → Int
later n = n * 10


pub zed : Int → Int
zed n = n * 3
